  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="16" spacingafter="2" fontweight="bold">D2 I-95 PEDESTRIAN BRIDGE</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="14" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold">C007 - Cap Design Basis (shared factors)</paragraph>
  <section name="WorkingNotes" capture="False" hide="true">
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="4" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#43505C">Working notes (hidden; not part of the submitted calculation): how this edition was produced, its tool status and the open bookkeeping items.</paragraph>
    <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="6">Cap design constants that no other journal report owns, written once for the three cap design reports. Written by scripts/build_cap_bpad.py --journal; edit the values there, not here.</paragraph>
  </section>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="6">Cap design constants shared by the three cap design calculations: C008 (End Bent 1), C009 (End Bent 2) and C010 (Pier Cap).</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="14" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="8" keepwithnext="True">1. Shared factors and limits</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="φ_f = 0.9" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
      <expbody>φ_f = 0.9</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">flexure resistance factor, tension-controlled sections, LRFD 5.5.4.2</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="φ_v = 0.9" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
      <expbody>φ_v = 0.9</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">shear and torsion resistance factor, normal-weight concrete, LRFD 5.5.4.2</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="φ_a = 0.9" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
      <expbody>φ_a = 0.9</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">axial resistance factor, LRFD 5.7.3.5</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="γ_e = 1" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
      <expbody>γ_e = 1</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">crack-control exposure factor, Class 1, LRFD 5.6.7</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="λ = 1" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
      <expbody>λ = 1</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">concrete density modification factor, normal weight, LRFD 5.4.2.8</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="s_proj = 12 in" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False" style="Required Input">
      <expbody>s_proj = 12 in</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">project spacing limit for face steel, FDOT SDG 4.1.4A–C</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="14" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="8" keepwithnext="True">2. Bar tables</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="Ab(k) = If(k == 3, 0.11 in^2, If(k == 4, 0.2 in^2, If(k == 5, 0.31 in^2, If(k == 6, 0.44 in^2, If(k == 7, 0.6 in^2, If(k == 8, 0.79 in^2, If(k == 9, 1 in^2, If(k == 10, 1.27 in^2, If(k == 11, 1.56 in^2, 0 in^2)))))))))" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>Ab(k) = If(k == 3, 0.11 in^2, If(k == 4, 0.2 in^2, If(k == 5, 0.31 in^2, If(k == 6, 0.44 in^2, If(k == 7, 0.6 in^2, If(k == 8, 0.79 in^2, If(k == 9, 1 in^2, If(k == 10, 1.27 in^2, If(k == 11, 1.56 in^2, 0 in^2)))))))))</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">bar area by bar number</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="11" spacingafter="1" spacingbefore="4" keepwithnext="True">
    <dynexp formula="Db(k) = If(k == 3, 0.375 in, If(k == 4, 0.5 in, If(k == 5, 0.625 in, If(k == 6, 0.75 in, If(k == 7, 0.875 in, If(k == 8, 1 in, If(k == 9, 1.128 in, If(k == 10, 1.27 in, If(k == 11, 1.41 in, 0 in)))))))))" mathlayout="on" showformula="True" showresult="False" showsteps="False">
      <expbody>Db(k) = If(k == 3, 0.375 in, If(k == 4, 0.5 in, If(k == 5, 0.625 in, If(k == 6, 0.75 in, If(k == 7, 0.875 in, If(k == 8, 1 in, If(k == 9, 1.128 in, If(k == 10, 1.27 in, If(k == 11, 1.41 in, 0 in)))))))))</expbody>
    </dynexp>
  </paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="5" textcolor="#43505C">bar diameter by bar number</paragraph>
  <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="14" spacingafter="6" fontweight="bold" textcolor="#1766A0" spacingbefore="8" keepwithnext="True">3. Discussion</paragraph>
  <embed spacingbefore="5" spacingafter="8">
    <table name="BasisDiscussion" capture="False" colwidths="1:620">
      <stylerule range="A1:A5" fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" valueformat="RoundedNumber(3, 3, {PriorityUnits: []})" border="Border(&quot;AllSides&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 0.6, &quot;#7189A6&quot;); Border(&quot;BetweenRows&quot;, &quot;Solid&quot;, 0.4, &quot;#7189A6&quot;);"/>
      <stylerule range="A1:A1" horzalign="Center" vertalign="Center"/>
      <row>
        <textcell name="BasisDiscussionR0C0" capture="False" background="#DCE7F3">
          <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0" fontweight="bold" horzalign="Center">Discussion</paragraph>
        </textcell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <textcell name="BasisDiscussionR1C0" capture="False" background="#F1F5FA">
          <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0">What this is. The factors, the project spacing limit and the bar tables shared by the cap design calculations. Geometry and materials are not repeated here; each cap report reads them from the report that owns them.</paragraph>
        </textcell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <textcell name="BasisDiscussionR2C0" capture="False" background="#F1F5FA">
          <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0">Read by. CapDesignEndBentOne, CapDesignEndBentTwo and CapDesignPier, as CapDesignBasis.φ_f, CapDesignBasis.φ_v, CapDesignBasis.φ_a, CapDesignBasis.γ_e, CapDesignBasis.λ, CapDesignBasis.s_proj, CapDesignBasis.Ab(k) and CapDesignBasis.Db(k).</paragraph>
        </textcell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <textcell name="BasisDiscussionR3C0" capture="False" background="#F1F5FA">
          <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0">Codes. AASHTO LRFD Bridge Design Specifications, 10th edition (2024); FDOT Structures Design Guidelines, January 2026; article numbers are cited beside each factor.</paragraph>
        </textcell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <textcell name="BasisDiscussionR4C0" capture="False" background="#F1F5FA">
          <paragraph fontfamily="Times New Roman" fontsize="10" spacingafter="0">Sources. Material properties come from Materials; geometry and covers come from BridgeGeometry_2Beam; the project stamp comes from ProjectInfo. The cap design reports read each of them from the report that owns it.</paragraph>
        </textcell>
      </row>
    </table>
  </embed>
